<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>技术 on Aliya の 笔记</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/</link><description>Recent content in 技术 on Aliya の 笔记</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>niri 快捷键图解：13 张图看懂列、工作区与布局</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/niri-keys/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:51:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/niri-keys/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-094.avif" alt="Featured image of post niri 快捷键图解：13 张图看懂列、工作区与布局" />niri 的键位有一百多条，光看配置文件记不住。我把它们画成了图：每个动作一张示意，配合键位表，看一遍就知道按下去会发生什么。 下图全部按本机实际配置</description></item><item><title>中文技术报告编写规范（Word 排版实践）</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83word-%E6%8E%92%E7%89%88%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%BC%96%E5%86%99%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83word-%E6%8E%92%E7%89%88%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-067.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 中文技术报告编写规范（Word 排版实践）" />中文技术报告的排版规范与自检流程，含三线表、插图、目录、字体、孤行页的具体做法与踩坑清单</description></item><item><title>模型网关升级与多重免费备用链实录</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:55:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-003.avif" alt="Featured image of post 模型网关升级与多重免费备用链实录" />把某家 AI 客户端的账号变成 OpenAI 兼容接口，再挂四层免费备用模型。这篇记录了升级时的三个坑、健康检查与回滚脚本、备用链的排序原则，以及哪些运维该交给定时任务。</description></item><item><title>给Hermes和大肥鱼接入代理并使用国外模型</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%BB%99hermes%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A5%E9%B1%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:37:16 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E7%BB%99hermes%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A5%E9%B1%BC%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%B9%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-127.avif" alt="Featured image of post 给Hermes和大肥鱼接入代理并使用国外模型" />想用 Gemini/OpenAI 这类国外模型，国内直连不通，得走代理。但 Hermes 和大肥鱼都是常驻服务，代理只能整服务加、不能按模型单独加。这篇讲清两种接法的代价和具体命令。</description></item></channel></rss>